# Only the Rust workspace and the dashboard's ClientApp are needed to build the
# acmebot container image. Everything else (legacy .NET backend, docs, tests,
# tooling) is excluded from the build context to keep builds fast and avoid
# leaking unrelated files.
#
# NOTE: Docker cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded, so
# every ancestor directory of a wanted path must also be explicitly un-ignored.
*
!rust
!rust/**
rust/target
rust/target/**
!src
!src/Acmebot.App
!src/Acmebot.App/ClientApp
!src/Acmebot.App/ClientApp/**
src/Acmebot.App/ClientApp/node_modules
src/Acmebot.App/ClientApp/node_modules/**
src/Acmebot.App/ClientApp/dist
src/Acmebot.App/ClientApp/dist/**
